<title>NETHERLANDS: Britain will join EMU ultimately - Waigel.</title>
<headline>Britain will join EMU ultimately - Waigel.</headline>
<dateline>NOORDWIJK, Netherlands 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel said on Saturday that he believed Britain would ultimately join European economic and monetary union, but gave no forecasts as to when.</p>
<p>Waigel told reporters after a meeting of European Union finance ministers, &quot;I am convinced that Great Britain will join monetary union at some point or other.</p>
<p>&quot;Britain is a stability-driven country.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
